@startuml Virement Interbancaire - Flux Événementiel Complet
title Virement Interbancaire (Alice [Bank A] → Bob [Bank B] 100 CAD) - Tous les Événements

autonumber
actor Client as C
participant "Gateway\n:8080" as GW
participant "payment-orch\n:8093" as PO
participant "Database\n+ Outbox" as DB_PO
participant "alias-service\n:8092" as AS
participant "Database\n+ Outbox" as DB_AS
participant "Bank A\nLocal System" as BA
participant "Bank B\nLocal System" as BB
participant "clearing-settle\n:8094" as CS
participant "Database\n+ Outbox" as DB_CS
participant "Kafka Broker" as KAFKA
participant "Redis" as REDIS

== 1. CLIENT INITIATE PAYMENT ==
C -> GW: POST /api/payment/initiate
GW -> PO: {idempotencyKey, alias, amount}

== 2. PAYMENT SERVICE - ATOMIC ==
PO -> REDIS: Check idempotencyKey
alt New Payment
  PO -> DB_PO: Store Payment (status=INITIATED)\n+ OutboxEvent(payment.initiated)
  DB_PO --> PO: COMMIT ✓
  PO -> REDIS: Cache idempotencyKey → paymentId (TTL 24h)
  PO --> GW: 201 Created
  GW --> C: {paymentId, status}
else Retry (cached)
  PO -> REDIS: Return cached paymentId
  PO --> GW: 200 OK (same payment)
end

== 3-4. PUBLISH: payment.initiated ==
DB_PO -> KAFKA: Outbox polling → publish event
KAFKA --> DB_PO: Acked ✓ Update published=TRUE

== 5. ALIAS SERVICE LISTENS ==
KAFKA -> AS: payment.initiated event
AS -> DB_AS: Store Alias resolution\n+ OutboxEvent(alias.resolved)
DB_AS --> AS: COMMIT ✓

== 6-7. PUBLISH: alias.resolved ==
DB_AS -> KAFKA: Outbox polling → publish event
KAFKA --> DB_AS: Acked ✓ Update published=TRUE

== 8. PAYMENT ORCH TRANSITION ==
KAFKA -> PO: alias.resolved event
PO -> DB_PO: Update status → DEBIT_REQUESTED\n+ OutboxEvent(payment.debit_requested)
DB_PO --> PO: COMMIT ✓

== 9-10. PUBLISH: payment.debit_requested ==
DB_PO -> KAFKA: Outbox polling → publish event
KAFKA --> DB_PO: Acked ✓ Update published=TRUE

== 11. BANK A PROCESSES ==
KAFKA -> BA: payment.debit_requested event
BA -> BA: ⚛️ ATOMIC: Debit Alice -100 CAD\n+ OutboxEvent(bank_a.debit_accepted)
BA -> KAFKA: Publish bank_a.debit_accepted

== 12. PAYMENT ORCH TRANSITION ==
KAFKA -> PO: bank_a.debit_accepted event
PO -> DB_PO: Update status → CREDIT_REQUESTED\n+ OutboxEvent(payment.credit_requested)
DB_PO --> PO: COMMIT ✓

== 13-14. PUBLISH: payment.credit_requested ==
DB_PO -> KAFKA: Outbox polling → publish event
KAFKA --> DB_PO: Acked ✓ Update published=TRUE

== 15. BANK B PROCESSES ==
KAFKA -> BB: payment.credit_requested event
BB -> BB: ⚛️ ATOMIC: Credit Bob +100 CAD\n+ OutboxEvent(bank_b.credit_accepted)
BB -> KAFKA: Publish bank_b.credit_accepted

== 16. PAYMENT ORCH ROUTES TO SETTLEMENT ==
KAFKA -> PO: bank_b.credit_accepted event
PO -> DB_PO: Update status → SETTLEMENT_TRIGGERED\n+ OutboxEvent(payment.settlement_triggered)
DB_PO --> PO: COMMIT ✓

== 17-18. PUBLISH: payment.settlement_triggered ==
DB_PO -> KAFKA: Outbox polling → publish event
KAFKA --> DB_PO: Acked ✓ Update published=TRUE

== 19. CLEARING & SETTLEMENT ==
KAFKA -> CS: payment.settlement_triggered event
CS -> DB_CS: ⚛️ ATOMIC: INSERT 2 Ledger entries (IMMUTABLE)\nDEBIT bank-a, CREDIT bank-b\n+ OutboxEvent(clearing.settlement_confirmed)
DB_CS --> CS: COMMIT ✓ Ledger balanced

== 20-21. PUBLISH: clearing.settlement_confirmed ==
DB_CS -> KAFKA: Outbox polling → publish event
KAFKA --> DB_CS: Acked ✓ Update published=TRUE

== 22. PAYMENT ORCH FINALIZES ==
KAFKA -> PO: clearing.settlement_confirmed event
PO -> DB_PO: Update status → SETTLED\n+ OutboxEvent(payment.settled)
DB_PO --> PO: COMMIT ✓

== 23-24. PUBLISH: payment.settled ==
DB_PO -> KAFKA: Outbox polling → publish event
KAFKA --> DB_PO: Acked ✓ Update published=TRUE

== ✓ VIREMENT COMPLETE ==
note over C, KAFKA
  ✅ FINAL STATE:
  • Alice balance: -100 CAD (immutable at Bank A)
  • Bob balance: +100 CAD (immutable at Bank B)
  • BC Ledger: DEBIT=CREDIT (append-only, signed)
  • Payment status: SETTLED (no reversal possible)
  • All 24 events logged in Kafka (7-day retention)
  • Every operation atomic (no half-states)
  
  ⏱️ Timeline: ~1500-2500ms total
  (Polling delays max ~500ms per event cycle)
  
  🔒 GUARANTEES:
  ✓ Exactly-once (idempotency + outbox)
  ✓ Atomic transactions
  ✓ Zero data loss
  ✓ Full audit trail
  ✓ Settlement finality
end note

@enduml
